OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA fine, but chilly start. Most
OL,6,Fparts staying dry with sunny spells,
OL,7,Fbut also occasional cloudier periods,
OL,8,Fwith the odd shower developing. These
OL,9,Fmost likely across the Pennines.
OL,10,FTemperatures near normal for October.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA clear, chilly evening,
OL,13,Fbefore cloud thickens from the
OL,14,Fsouthwest overnight. Perhaps the odd
OL,15,Ffrost patch. Winds strengthening for a
OL,16,Ftime after midnight, especially along
OL,17,Fcoasts, with rain spreading north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
