OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FLargely wet with persistent
OL,6,Frain for some, occasionally heavy, and
OL,7,Fonly gradually clearing east. Best of
OL,8,Fany drier weather will be in the west
OL,9,Flater. Winds also strengthening,
OL,10,Fespecially later.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FChilly
OL,13,Fstart Saturday, but turning wet and
OL,14,Fwindy with rain spreading east. Windy
OL,15,FSunday with showers and brighter
OL,16,Fintervals. Briefly drier overnight,
OL,17,Fbefore further rain and stronger winds
OL,18,Ffollow Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
